{
  "slug": "kotlinsense",
  "name": "Kotlinsense",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Kotlin language server for Claude Code. Automatically injects type-error diagnostics, missing import detection, and null safety violations into Claude's context after every .kt file edit — no manual compile step needed. Works for any Kotlin or Android project.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **3 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `kotlin-android-patterns` (Kotlin and Android code patterns that produce LSP-clean, idiomatic code), `kotlin-diagnostics` (Common Kotlin diagnostics from the language server and how to fix them), `kotlinsense-usage` (How to use the KotlinSense plugin effectively)\n- **Commands** (3): `install`, `navigate`, `status`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install kotlinsense@claude-community` from `SUDARSHANCHAUDHARI/KotlinSense`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
